### 1. Get All Facilities
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/facilities
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Get All Inspections
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/inspections
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Create a New Inspection
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/inspections
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "facility_id": 1,
